    "chunk_id": "doc113_p1_c1",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Mobile Registration. In your mobile browse go to the UT Dallas webpage and click on the hamburger menu. Select Galaxy.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Mobile Registration",
    "n_sentences": 3,
    "token_count": 30
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p3_c2",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Log in with your NetID and password.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 1,
    "token_count": 9
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p5_c3",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Select Manage My Classes.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 1,
    "token_count": 7
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p6_c4",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Select Schedule Planner. Open Schedule Planner.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 2,
    "token_count": 12
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p7_c5",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Allow Schedule Planner to open a new window.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 1,
    "token_count": 11
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p8_c6",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Adjust filters if needed.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 1,
    "token_count": 7
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p11_c7",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Click Schedule at the bottom and Generate.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 1,
    "token_count": 11
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p12_c8",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Click on view to see a detailed view. When you find the schedule you want click Shopping Cart.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 2,
    "token_count": 24
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p13_c9",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "You can \"Validate\" the schedule to see if there may be any registration issues. You can \"Edit\" the items in your cart to allow waitlisting, remove a class from the cart, select credit hours on a variable class or enter a permission number if given one for registration.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 2,
    "token_count": 68
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p15_c10",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "You will get a confirmation letting you know that you were registered or letting you know if there were any issues.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 1,
    "token_count": 29
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p16_c11",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Your current schedule will be displayed. If you want to drop a class, click on the drop classes.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 2,
    "token_count": 24
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p17_c12",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "Select the class you want to drop and click Save.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 1,
    "token_count": 13
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "doc113_p18_c13",
    "doc_id": "doc113",
    "text": "You'll be asked to confirm that you want to make the change. For questions regarding the Schedule Planner, email records@utdallas.edu.",
    "source_title": "Mobile Registration",
    "section_heading": "Overview",
    "n_sentences": 2,
    "token_count": 34
